WEBVTT

00:00:02.020 --> 00:00:11.520
So, we're here with Frank Luna, great fella in Minca, and we'll have a little talk.

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:18.240
Frank, please introduce yourself as you like, as you prefer.

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:25.460
Hi, how are you? I'm Frank Luna. I'm a singer and a born singer-songwriter from the city of Barranquilla.

00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:29.700
I'm 34 years old and currently living here in Minca.

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:36.760
I'm also a videographer and filmmaker, and I'm working on a beautiful documentary project here in Minca.

00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:41.740
And I'm here enjoying good music and natural rhythms.
